WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
June, nineteen fourteen.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:06.330
In Sarajevo, Archduke Franz
Ferdinand of Austria-Hungary is

3
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.790
assassinated.

4
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.930
Soon, one great power after
another is dragged into war.

5
00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:14.810
The war lasts until nineteen eighteen.

6
00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.750
So how can one killing pull
a whole continent into war?

7
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.470
Was that single killing
really the cause?

8
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.550
In this mission, you'll weigh
up the causes of the war.

9
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.623
Then you'll see the winners
make peace at Versailles in

10
00:00:27.673 --> 00:00:30.430
nineteen nineteen,
punishing Germany harshly,

11
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.710
and follow a chain of
events towards another war.

12
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:38.260
Your mission: work out why war
broke out in nineteen fourteen.
